<title>USA: PerfectData says Polak boosts bid.</title>
<headline>PerfectData says Polak boosts bid.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerfectData Corp on Friday said it has received a revised bid from Polak Investment Group, raising its offer for a 40 percent stake in PerfectData to $6.05 a share from a previous $5.50 a share.</p>
<p>The new offer calls for Polak to pay $2.25 per share in cash and $3.80 per share in eight pct convertible preferred stock.  The previous bid called for $2.00 in cash and $3.50 per share in eight percent convertible preferred stock for a 42 percent stake.</p>
<p>In a statement, PerfectData said it will consider the new offer, as well as review other options.</p>
